          "settings": {
            "question": "Stuck in Transit? Believe it's Lost?",
            "answer": "<p>First off, we want to make it clear that this is an extremely frustrating circumstance for the both of us. When we ship out items, we expect that the carrier will handle and ship the items out quickly and in good faith. Once the item is in the carrier's possession, we can only see and know as much as you do and that's what is indicated on the tracking information. Sometimes and for unexpected reasons items are stuck in transit much longer than usual. In the case there's been no updates please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:customerservice@ornamentallyyou.com\">customerservice@ornamentallyyou.com</a>. The next steps would be that we would have to open a ticket with the carrier, and get official confirmation that the items are lost. Once we get an update from the carrier, we will email you with the item's status. If it's been an unreasonably long amount of time with no update or carrier response, then we will likely presuppose the item being lost and send you a new one promptly. If the supposedly lost item does turn up, we ask that you contact us and return the item in good faith.</p><p>** Understandably, we cannot refund substantially delayed orders due to carrier mishaps or adverse weather conditions.</p>",
            "category": "Shipping"
